---
import site from '../data/site.json';
---

<p class="lede" data-set>
  I work with founders, research teams, and people building AI products. If you are
  working on something involving AI agents or user representation, tell me what you
  are trying to do.
</p>

<div class="cover-actions" data-set style="--set-delay:80ms">
  <a class="btn" href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.cta}</a>
  <a class="btn btn-out" href={site.cv}>Download CV</a>
</div>
